1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's Novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 7=

17
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:53,640
Come here.

18
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,520
I'll help you.

19
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:02,399
Do you know what you're saying?

20
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,959
I said,

21
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,799
I'll help you.

22
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,640
Are you sure?

23
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,719
What?

24
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,239
Backing out, Your Majesty?

25
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,840
Lu Yunluo!

26
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,920
Jia, Yi!

27
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,000
Two buckets of ice!

28
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,079
His Majesty needs to cool down.

29
00:01:59,173 --> 00:02:00,827
(Cold Palace)

30
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,200
This is triple-strength coptis tea.

31
00:02:03,239 --> 00:02:04,879
It'll counteract

32
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,239
the drug in your system.

33
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,800
Drink it, or I'm leaving.

34
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,360
I never said I wouldn't.

35
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:28,960
(That body...)

36
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:30,360
(Absolutely flawless.)

37
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:33,800
Like what you see?

38
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,319
Very much.

39
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:36,919
Then why do you keep running?

40
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:41,479
I'm not the one who drugged you.

41
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,599
Go to Consort Yao.

42
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:44,159
You...

43
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,319
What do you take me for?

44
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,280
Would just any woman do?

45
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,000
So innocent, aren't you?

46
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,120
Your Majesty,

47
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,000
is this your first time?

48
00:02:56,199 --> 00:02:56,840
I...

49
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,000
What if it is?

50
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,919
Sorry, then.

51
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,280
I prefer

52
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:06,080
a man with experience.

53
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,840
Experience?

54
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,800
Yes.

55
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,759
Then why don't you teach me

56
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:14,800
what it means to be experienced?

57
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:16,719
I...

58
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:19,759
I'm a beginner too.

59
00:03:22,039 --> 00:03:23,240
Or would you rather

60
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,120
I practice

61
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,199
with someone else?

62
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,520
(Stay calm.)

63
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:31,919
(Lust will be the death of you.)

64
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,759
Your Majesty,

65
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:37,560
Still burning with desire?

66
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,719
What do you think?

67
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,520
Jia, Yi!

68
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,759
Another bucket of ice!

69
00:03:48,759 --> 00:03:49,319
You...

70
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,599
You!

71
00:03:58,590 --> 00:04:00,270
(Cold Palace)

72
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,680
What time is it?

73
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:13,960
About 5 a.m.

74
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:17,360
It's time for court, Your Majesty.

75
00:04:28,439 --> 00:04:29,439
Go to the library.

76
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,839
Fetch me a few books.

77
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,279
What sort of books?

78
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:36,720
Well...

79
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,240
The...

80
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,600
This sort.

81
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,680
What did you say?

82
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:50,839
His Majesty spent the night
in the Cold Palace?

83
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,639
Without a doubt.

84
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,480
I hear

85
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:56,000
they made quite a commotion.

86
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:59,360
That useless Consort Yao!

87
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,000
All my efforts wasted.

88
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,480
Calm down, Your Majesty.

89
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,839
Consort Yao was confined last night.

90
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,319
Luckily, our people were quick.

91
00:05:07,519 --> 00:05:09,519
All the Passion Incense is gone.

92
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,399
As long as she stays silent,

93
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,360
His Majesty

94
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:14,879
should find no link to us.

95
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:19,120
She wouldn't dare implicate me.

96
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,480
One more thing.

97
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:24,199
I've learned

98
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:27,360
the woman in green he was looking for

99
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,240
was the one from the Cold Palace.

100
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:37,759
Even in the Cold Palace,
she's still causing trouble.

101
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,240
It seems

102
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:42,759
I should see her for myself.

103
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:45,680
What if His Majesty protects her?

104
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:52,040
I had Chancellor Lu imprisoned.

105
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,800
I can certainly send Lu Yunluo

106
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:57,560
from the Cold Palace

107
00:05:58,439 --> 00:06:00,120
to her coffin.

108
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,360
Yinshuang.

109
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,680
When did His Majesty leave last night?

110
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,399
About 5 a.m.

111
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:10,560
It was already light.

112
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:12,680
What kind of drug

113
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,639
is that strong?

114
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,560
It kept him going all night!

115
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:17,920
I'll have to

116
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:19,279
get some myself one day.

117
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,439
My lady.

118
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:21,879
What would you want it for?

119
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:24,519
Once I'm out of the palace,

120
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:25,720
there'll be handsome men everywhere.

121
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:28,040
Then I can do whatever I want!

122
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:31,120
If you're so fond of handsome men,

123
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,079
why didn't you last night...

124
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:39,000
His Majesty is Donglan's handsomest man.

125
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,759
You don't get it.

126
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:45,600
He's trouble.

127
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,000
Get involved with him,

128
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,160
and you lose your freedom.

129
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,439
Plus, all the complications.

130
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,759
Not worth it.

131
00:06:51,399 --> 00:06:53,079
What do you mean?

132
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,439
I mean

133
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,879
Bad deal.

134
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,879
Exactly.

135
00:06:57,720 --> 00:07:00,120
But he's the richest man in the realm!

136
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,000
Just you wait.

137
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,480
Once my shop opens,

138
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,240
I'll be richer than he is.

139
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,680
Your Majesty!

140
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:08,759
Your Majesty.

141
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,879
Here's the ice chest you wanted.

142
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,600
With this,

143
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,319
I can make cold drinks and ice pops.

144
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:20,160
In this heat,

145
00:07:20,439 --> 00:07:21,519
they'll sell like crazy.

146
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,759
Ice pops?

147
00:07:23,799 --> 00:07:24,940
(Cold Palace Refreshments)

148
00:07:26,986 --> 00:07:27,938
(Cold Palace Refreshments
Welcome!)

149
00:07:27,938 --> 00:07:28,998
(Ice Pops: 50 coins
First come, first served!)

150
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,399
Step right up! Don't miss out!

151
00:07:34,399 --> 00:07:36,000
(Cold Palace Refreshments) Beat the
heat!

152
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,000
One bite is heaven.

153
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,000
Two will chill you to the core!

154
00:07:39,012 --> 00:07:40,066
(Chilled Sour Plum Drink: 30 coins)

155
00:07:40,066 --> 00:07:41,118
(Colorful Ice Pops: 50 coins)

156
00:07:41,118 --> 00:07:42,045
(Limited quantity.
First come, first served!)

157
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,319
No wonder no one's buying!

158
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:54,040
You two!

159
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,399
Why are you two posted here?

160
00:07:56,279 --> 00:07:57,959
You'll scare the customers off!

161
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,199
Is this how you run a shop?

162
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,480
Put the swords away!

163
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,120
- Yes!
- Yes!

164
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:05,639
Hold this.

165
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:06,720
Come on.

166
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:07,519
Do as I do.

167
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,160
Welcome!

168
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,000
Welcome...

169
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:13,600
Wait.

170
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,480
Smile.

171
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:17,480
That's it!

172
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:18,279
Now,

173
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,879
welcome!

174
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,720
- Welcome!
- Welcome!

175
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,399
Your hips.

176
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:25,480
Stick your hips out.

177
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,399
You too. Come on.

178
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,879
Welcome!

179
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:30,240
- Welcome!
- Welcome!

180
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:33,480
Welcome!

181
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,960
- Welcome!
- Welcome!

182
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,320
Just like that.

183
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,600
Hold it.

184
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,000
Welcome!

185
00:08:42,423 --> 00:08:44,030
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

186
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,360
Cold drinks, 30 coins!

187
00:08:46,559 --> 00:08:47,519
Ice pops, 50 coins!

188
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:48,559
Form a line!

189
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,360
Enough for everyone!

190
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,000
I'll take two orange ones.

191
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:52,879
Here.

192
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:53,399
Thank you.

193
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:54,840
Save me two bayberry juices!

194
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,559
Coming right up!

195
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:58,399
Me too!

196
00:08:58,399 --> 00:08:59,840
I want this one too.

197
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,879
Quite cheap.

198
00:09:00,879 --> 00:09:01,519
I want that.

199
00:09:01,519 --> 00:09:02,240
That one's good.

200
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,600
Me too!

201
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,399
Since when did the Cold Palace

202
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:09,000
become a marketplace?

203
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,519
Matron,

204
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:13,039
the Empress opened a refreshment shop
here.

205
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,759
I don't know where she got all this.

206
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:17,039
How dare she

207
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:19,080
open a shop inside the palace?

208
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,960
I've heard

209
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,039
His Majesty gave his consent.

210
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,420
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

211
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,279
Limited ice cream tomorrow!

212
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:31,440
First come, first served!

213
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,679
Outrageous!

214
00:09:41,003 --> 00:09:41,997
(Cold Palace)

215
00:09:42,039 --> 00:09:43,240
500 taels!

216
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,960
A full 500 taels!

217
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:49,519
One step closer to freedom!

218
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,399
The Cold Palace

219
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:53,480
is a real gold mine!

220
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,120
My lady, you look

221
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:58,000
just like a miser.

222
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,799
Wrong.

223
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,440
A business genius.

224
00:10:03,519 --> 00:10:05,840
Now I've cornered the budget market,

225
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,840
it's time to go upmarket.

226
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,320
Start with bird's nest.

227
00:10:13,879 --> 00:10:15,320
Add curds for richness,

228
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:17,879
then a splash of grape wine.

229
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,559
Finally,

230
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,759
sprinkle on some gold leaf.

231
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:26,440
Isn't that a bit expensive to make?

232
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,519
Silly girl.

233
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,759
Do nobles lack money?

234
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:34,240
They want prestige no one else has.

235
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,600
Will anyone buy it, my lady?

236
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,639
Only one way to find out.

237
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,120
Keep counting.

238
00:10:53,159 --> 00:10:54,639
Consort Lan would like

239
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:56,360
one of every cold drink.

240
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,279
Whenever new products come out,

241
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,399
send them to Liuyun Palace right away.

242
00:11:02,279 --> 00:11:03,159
Here's the deposit.

243
00:11:06,279 --> 00:11:08,279
This is just the deposit?

244
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,320
My lady loves good food.

245
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:13,039
She never skimps on food.

246
00:11:14,039 --> 00:11:15,320
Your lady is wonderful.

247
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,039
So wonderful.

248
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:16,919
Of course she is.

249
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:20,840
Consort Lan is a friend worth having.

250
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:24,440
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

251
00:11:43,403 --> 00:11:47,433
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

252
00:11:47,823 --> 00:11:52,043
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

253
00:11:52,083 --> 00:11:56,263
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

254
00:11:56,323 --> 00:12:00,513
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

255
00:12:00,853 --> 00:12:04,913
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

256
00:12:04,983 --> 00:12:09,163
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

257
00:12:09,603 --> 00:12:12,973
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

258
00:12:13,443 --> 00:12:18,123
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

259
00:12:19,783 --> 00:12:21,933
♪No finery to rival spring♪

260
00:12:22,113 --> 00:12:26,413
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

261
00:12:28,823 --> 00:12:30,573
♪Where is beauty found?♪

262
00:12:30,753 --> 00:12:35,183
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

263
00:12:35,743 --> 00:12:37,313
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

264
00:12:37,333 --> 00:12:39,803
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

265
00:12:39,873 --> 00:12:41,953
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

266
00:12:42,113 --> 00:12:43,883
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

267
00:12:44,493 --> 00:12:45,763
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

268
00:12:45,993 --> 00:12:48,393
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

269
00:12:48,633 --> 00:12:50,933
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

270
00:12:51,213 --> 00:12:55,533
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
